1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,500
Every AgentReel video begins with a single prompt: vision, topic, and audience.

2
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:14,000
In our pipeline, seven specialized agents coordinate: Planner sets the plan, Researcher checks facts, Scriptwriter writes the story,

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Storyboarder designs shots, Asset Generator creates visuals, Editor builds the edit, and Critic verifies quality.

4
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Next, multiple media tracks assemble in lockstep: visual cards, voiceover audio, and burned SubRip captions.

5
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Before delivery, the Critic inspects eighteen quality rules. Any caption violation triggers an automated repair loop.

6
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:44,000
The result is a broadcast-ready vertical video, built by AI agents. Come and build with us.
